      "Summary": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "7FD6AC57464FE9613E70FFB47048C300",
        "SourceString": "Adan, the hermit, is convinced I'm part of some grand cosmic tale. He wants me to fetch a Crown of the Sand King, a rock, apparently, and gather whispers from locals Marti and Lysara. He claims these will help him finish his magnum opus. I’m not sure if he’s a genius or just broken, but he’s desperate enough that he can’t even leave his hut—ran out of ink three days ago.",
